@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000


### 1. Get Purchase Bill KPI Card Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/bill/kpi/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. List Purchase Bills (Paginated with Filters & Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/bill/?status=unpaid&search=Chicking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 3. Create New Purchase Bill
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/bill/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor": 1,
  "po_reference": "INV 0123 - Chicking",
  "bill_date": "2026-04-17",
  "due_date": "2026-04-30",
  "payment_terms": "NET 10",
  "due_date_note": "Damaged Goods",
  "note": "Initial Purchase Order Bill",
  "from_name": "TUNGSTON LABS",
  "from_address": "Tungston Labs, Ullampilly Building",
  "from_phone": "+91 97783 77526",
  "from_email": "info@tungstonlabs.com",
  "discount": "19.69",
  "round_off": "0.00",
  "items": [
    {
      "product": 1,
      "particular": "Product 1 description",
      "quantity": "1.00",
      "hs_code": "25366",
      "rate": "197.00",
      "vat_percentage": "15.00"
    },
    {
      "product": 2,
      "particular": "Product 2 description",
      "quantity": "1.00",
      "hs_code": "25366",
      "rate": "197.00",
      "vat_percentage": "15.00"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 4. Get Purchase Bill Detail by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/bill/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. Update Purchase Bill (Full PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/bill/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendor": 1,
  "bill_number": "BIL00001",
  "po_reference": "INV 0123 - Chicking",
  "bill_date": "2026-04-17",
  "due_date": "2026-04-30",
  "payment_terms": "NET 10",
  "due_date_note": "Damaged Goods",
  "note": "Updated Purchase Bill Note",
  "discount": "19.69",
  "items": [
    {
      "particular": "Product 1 description updated",
      "quantity": "2.00",
      "hs_code": "25366",
      "rate": "197.00",
      "vat_percentage": "15.00"
    }
  ]
}

###

### 6. Update Purchase Bill Payment Status (Partial PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/bill/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_paid": "400.00"
}

###

### 7. Delete Purchase Bill
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/bill/1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
